<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第二幕 · 模型外面那一圈里头</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>让它只能碰该碰的</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{height: 380, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24, alignItems: "stretch"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 28, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "#0F6E56"}}>边界内 · 能碰</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", marginTop: 18}}><Text style={{fontSize: 23, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.9}}>· 项目目录读写</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 23, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.9}}>· 构建与测试命令</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 23, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.9}}>· 本地依赖安装</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 2, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.22)"}}></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 28, background: "rgba(163,45,45,0.06)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "#A32D2D"}}>边界外 · 碰不到</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", marginTop: 18}}><Text style={{fontSize: 23, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.9}}>· 生产配置</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 23, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.9}}>· 凭据</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 23, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.9}}>· 任意外网地址</Text></Box></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.45, padding: 24, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 28}}>你们本来就有一圈边界——现在把 agent 也圈进去。</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>14 / 37</Text></Box></Box>
